1	// Acceptance test for the change request:
2	//   "Let me mark a project as active, on hold or finished. Show which it is."
3	//
4	// A project carries a STATUS — one of three stages: active, on hold, or finished. Every project is
5	// SHOWN with which stage it is at (project-status), and the add-a-project form gains a control to
6	// PICK the stage a new project starts at (project-form-status). The picked stage is held by the
7	// server, so it survives a fresh load, and the picker genuinely drives the value — two projects
